        {
            "id": "https://www.jujubemonster.com/morning-song.html",
            "url": "https://www.jujubemonster.com/morning-song.html",
            "title": "Morning Song",
            "summary": "Dawn had taken in the stars And left the faint white moon. O white moon, you are lonely, It is the same with me, But we have the world to roam over, Only the lonely are free. -- Sara Teasdale (1884-1933)",
